WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.999
RUFUS: Unless the internal audience
already knows more than the press
release says,

00:00:02.999 --> 00:00:05.997
RUFUS: which is entirely possible. These
things rarely stay completely contained
inside a

00:00:05.997 --> 00:00:08.996
RUFUS: company.

00:00:09.061 --> 00:00:11.626
ALEX: So what changed today, concretely?

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:16.072
RUFUS: The executive vacuum is closed.
The market had a week of pricing

00:00:16.072 --> 00:00:20.434
RUFUS: in various worst cases. The
reinstatement resets the baseline.

00:00:20.544 --> 00:00:24.448
JAMIE: And the investigation becomes the
thing to watch. Not because we know

00:00:24.448 --> 00:00:28.353
JAMIE: it'll produce a damaging finding,
but because it's unresolved and it
involves

00:00:28.353 --> 00:00:32.257
JAMIE: the same circumstances that
caused a brief but real leadership
crisis at

00:00:32.257 --> 00:00:36.162
JAMIE: the most important company in AI
hardware.
